### Create the character Borgrim
POST http://localhost:8080/characters
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "characterName": "Borgrim"
}

### Name already exist (case insensitive) -> 409 conflict (Result-based validation)
POST http://localhost:8080/characters
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "characterName": "borgrim"
}

### Define race to Borgrim: Dwarf
PUT http://localhost:8080/characters/Borgrim/race
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "raceName": "DWARF"
}

### Define profession to Borgrim: Miner
PUT http://localhost:8080/characters/Borgrim/profession
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "professionName": "MINER"
}

### Get latest snapshot of Borgrim
GET http://localhost:8080/characters/borgrim/snapshots/latest

### Get all Borgrim snapshots
GET http://localhost:8080/characters/Borgrim/snapshots

### Get all races
GET http://localhost:8080/races

### Get all professions
GET http://localhost:8080/professions


### Name blank → 400 InvalidInput (Result-based validation)
POST http://localhost:8080/characters
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "characterName": "     "
}

### No body → 400 (Result-based validation)
POST http://localhost:8080/characters
Content-Type: application/json

### [to execute 6 times] Cannot add any more point → 422 RuleViolation (Result-based validation)
POST http://localhost:8080/characters/Borgrim/characteristics/strength/points
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "operation": "ADD"
}